@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "voimed" as Daemon
participant "Voime addon" as Addon
participant "Fcitx UI" as UI

Daemon -> Addon : Partial { segment_id, text }
Addon -> UI : setPreedit(Partial)

Daemon -> Addon : State { recording: false, finalizing: true }
note over Addon : 保留最后 Partial；不再刷新预览

Daemon -> Addon : Final { segment_id, text }
Addon -> UI : setPreedit(Text())
Addon -> UI : commitString(text)

note over Addon, UI
  Finalizing 期间保留最后 Partial，不再刷新；
  Final 到达后才清空并提交。
end note
@enduml
